=== range() Function Tests ===

1. range(1, 3):
   Result:  [1, 2, 3]
   Expected: [1, 2, 3]

2. range(3, 1):
   Result:  []
   Expected: []

3. range(1, 1):
   Result:  [1]
   Expected: [1]

4. range(5, 10):
   Result:  [5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10]
   Expected: [5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10]

5. range(-2, 2):
   Result:  [-2, -1, 0, 1, 2]
   Expected: [-2, -1, 0, 1, 2]

6. range(0, 3):
   Result:  [0, 1, 2, 3]
   Expected: [0, 1, 2, 3]

7. range(42, 42):
   Result:  [42]
   Expected: [42]

8. range(2, 1):
   Result:  []
   Expected: []

=== All range() Tests Complete ===
